{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch213HrPaGaeaYqGyzhWJ", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I'm not signing off. I still have open suspected bugs, and the sign-off would report PASS.\n\n**Confirmed and filed (1):**\n- **Operator precedence in the amount editor.** `7 + 3 × 2` shows \"= $20\" in the preview and commits $20; it should be 13. The developer confirmed and logged it.\n\n**Filed but not reproduced by the developer (3):**\n- **Expense history blank in portrait.** The history sheet shows no rows in portrait, even after scrolling. In landscape the same data renders: Today → Food $12.9 (Total $12.9), and 13 November → Groceries $40 and Rent $20 (Total $60). The developer couldn't reproduce it from my steps.\n- **Category rows without icons.** In Settings → Savings → Category limits, the Food and Transport rows have no icon, while the other rows in Settings have one. Not reproduced by the developer.\n- **Category limit card ignores period spend.** With Food limited to $50 per period, the amount editor's Food card shows \"$1 of $50\" and \"$49 left\" (and \"$12.9 of $50\" with a $12.9 draft). The period already has $60 of Food spend (Groceries + Rent), so it should show over the limit. I reproduced this twice. The developer couldn't reproduce it from my steps.\n\n**Checked and looked correct:**\n- Keypad entry and decimals; a zero amount can't be submitted; clearing works.\n- Expense save, then the totals on Analytics and the Categories tab ($72.9 total).\n- Expense detail: Edit, then exit (the change is discarded); Delete with UNDO (works when tapped promptly).\n- Budget sheet: Daily/Weekly/Biweekly toggles persist, and the breakdowns match the numbers.\n- Empty category name is rejected; Cancel on the limit dialog keeps \"No limit\".\n- Rotation keeps the data.\n\n**Changes I left in the app data:**\n- The Food limit is now \"$50 per period\". I couldn't find a way to clear it, so it's still set.\n- Food $12.9 was deleted during UNDO testing and re-entered. It is now timestamped 02:05 AM, not the original 01:57 AM.\n- The split is back on Daily.\n\nI'd recommend re-checking the period-spend limit card and the portrait history list before release."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2696, "cache_read_input_tokens": 324422, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2696}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "297d4403-6b20-4b0e-99be-7752c33b6e1b", "uuid": "9b431c41-1fdf-4a13-97c8-f68d8f530572", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T02:05:33.942Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch213HV4XNDLXdPjEiAXL"}
